00:36:17.310 --> 00:36:20.930
Votou sim.

224
00:36:21.250 --> 00:36:22.670
Um, senhor...

225
00:36:22.670 --> 00:36:23.310
Registro...

226
00:36:23.310 --> 00:36:25.070
É, retificar o voto do deputado Gil.

